OL,3,GNEWSAPolice renew appeal into death of
OL,4,Abiker, 19, who fell into sea after
OL,5,Acliffside crash
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice have renewed an appeal for
OL,8,Finformation about the death of a
OL,9,F19-year-old motorcyclist who fell into
OL,10,Fthe sea following a crash.
OL,12,FOfficers from North Wales Police were
OL,13,Fcalled to reports of a crash involving
OL,14,Fa motorcycle on Marine Drive on the
OL,15,FGreat Orme in Llandudno, Conwy county,
OL,16,Fat 22:30 GMT on October 29.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
