OL,3,GNEWSAPolice renew appeal into death of
OL,4,Abiker, 19, who fell into sea after
OL,5,Acliffside crash
OL,6,
OL,7,FA multi-agency response including
OL,8,Fpolice, the RNLI and HM Coastguard was
OL,9,Flaunched and the man was recovered from
OL,10,Fthe water. He was airlifted to Ysbyty
OL,11,FGwynedd in Bangor, where he was
OL,12,Fpronounced dead.
OL,14,FThree males, aged between 17 and 18,
OL,15,Fwere arrested and interviewed in
OL,16,Fconnection with the incident, and have
OL,17,Fsince been released while enquiries
OL,18,Fcontinue.
